{
  "title": "Sentry ingestion SLO probe: trace streams",
  "description": "One probe trace per second through the Sentry SDK and through OTLP: latency to queryable, reliability, child-span completeness, and probe health. Source: sentry-slo-probe, datadog/trace-streams-dashboard.json.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "sentry_org",
      "prefix": "sentry_org",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "sentry_project",
      "prefix": "sentry_project",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "*"
    }
  ],
  "notify_list": [],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Sentry ingestion SLO probe: trace streams.** Two streams each send one probe trace (a root plus 4 child spans) every second: **SDK** through the Sentry SDK, **OTLP** through OpenTelemetry to Sentry's OTLP endpoint. Each minute they report how long traces took to become queryable, how many arrived, and whether all child spans were stored.\n\nHealthy baseline (Nov 2026): p50 about 50s, p95 about 70-80s, about 60 traces in flight, 100% received and complete. Slowdowns show up as rising p95 and in-flight count on both streams together. `unanswered` counts sends Sentry did not answer within 25s (counted as sent); the other probe events are the probe's own trouble. Metric definitions: see the README section *The trace stream* in sentry-slo-probe.",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Latency: send to queryable in Sentry (seconds)",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "p95 latency, SDK vs OTLP",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "horizontal",
              "legend_columns": [
                "avg",
                "max",
                "value"
              ],
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "p95_0",
                      "query": "avg:sentry.trace_stream.latency_ms.p95{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "p95_1",
                      "query": "avg:sentry.trace_stream_otlp.latency_ms.p95{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "p95_0 / 1000",
                      "alias": "SDK p95"
                    },
                    {
                      "formula": "p95_1 / 1000",
                      "alias": "OTLP p95"
                    }
                  ],
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear"
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 120",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "120s"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 6,
              "height": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "p50 latency, SDK vs OTLP",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "horizontal",
              "legend_columns": [
                "avg",
                "max",
                "value"
              ],
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "p50_0",
                      "query": "avg:sentry.trace_stream.latency_ms.p50{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "p50_1",
                      "query": "avg:sentry.trace_stream_otlp.latency_ms.p50{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "p50_0 / 1000",
                      "alias": "SDK p50"
                    },
                    {
                      "formula": "p50_1 / 1000",
                      "alias": "OTLP p50"
                    }
                  ],
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 6,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 6,
              "height": 4
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Reliability: traces Sentry received that became queryable",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "SDK: received / sent",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "precision": 2,
              "autoscale": false,
              "custom_unit": "%",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "rcv",
                      "query": "sum:sentry.trace_stream.received{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "snt",
                      "query": "sum:sentry.trace_stream.sent{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "100 * rcv / snt"
                    }
                  ],
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": ">=",
                      "value": 99.9,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 99.9,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "query_value",
              "title": "OTLP: received / sent",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "precision": 2,
              "autoscale": false,
              "custom_unit": "%",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "rcv",
                      "query": "sum:sentry.trace_stream_otlp.received{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "snt",
                      "query": "sum:sentry.trace_stream_otlp.sent{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}.as_count()",
                      "aggregator": "sum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "100 * rcv / snt"
                    }
                  ],
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": ">=",
                      "value": 99.9,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 99.9,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 3,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Lost traces per minute (sent - received)",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "horizontal",
              "legend_columns": [
                "avg",
                "max",
                "value"
              ],
              "requests": [
                {
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "snt_0",
                      "query": "sum:sentry.trace_stream.sent{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}.as_count()"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "rcv_0",
                      "query": "sum:sentry.trace_stream.received{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}.as_count()"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "snt_1",
                      "query": "sum:sentry.trace_stream_otlp.sent{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}.as_count()"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "rcv_1",
                      "query": "sum:sentry.trace_stream_otlp.received{$sentry_org,$sentry_project}.as_count()"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "snt_0 - rcv_0",
                      "alias": "SDK lost"
                    },
                    {
                      "formula": "snt_1 - rcv_1",
                      "alias": "OTLP lost"
                    }
                  ],
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "include_zero": true,
                "scale": "linear"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 6,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 6,
              "height": 3
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 4
      }
    },
    {
